<title>OMAN: Al Ahlia Insurance Co lifts 96 net.</title>
<headline>Al Ahlia Insurance Co lifts 96 net.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (Omani rials, unless stated, rounded)</p>
<p>  Net profit			709,688	vs     613,768</p>
<p>  Pre-tax			   723,388	vs     633,518</p>
<p>  Underwriting result	   654,755	vs     723,456</p>
<p>  Investment, other income    736,633	vs     515,785</p>
<p>  Gross premiums written     5.575 million vs   5.751 million</p>
<p>Full name: Al Ahlia Insurance Co SAOG</p>
<p>Note: The board recommended a 15 percent dividend. In 1995 no dividend was distributed.</p>
</text>
